    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Rent out anything. The only calendar booking system for WordPress that allows you to manage short-term and long-term rentals in the most human-friendly interface. Charge by the hour, day, or night. Enables clients to pick available time slots directly from the online booking calendar and reserve any number of dates and/or things.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://form.getmotopress.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Booking Calendar Plugin Demo</a> with the Dashboard access.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Perfect for any rental type</h3>\n<p>Absolutely agile, this free WordPress booking plugin was built to cover various rental periods and reservation-based business needs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hourly rentals (bikes, services, rental studios).</li>\n<li>Daily rentals/full-day (tours, equipment, training).</li>\n<li>Nightly stays/changeover days (vacation rentals, inns, hotel rooms).</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vw6LoYjf95Y?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Smart inventory and availability control</h3>\n<p>Your booking resources are fully manageable: create an unlimited number of booking calendars, rental types, and inventory units.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create unlimited rental items with their own calendars or within one calendar.</li>\n<li>Add item variations within one calendar (VIP tickets, regular tickets, discounted tickets).</li>\n<li>Set quantity available per item (e.g. 2 double rooms and 1 single room).</li>\n<li>Create different timeslots for different days.</li>\n<li>Automatically track availability when items are booked &#8211; or change it manually.</li>\n<li>Display item images and descriptions right in the WordPress booking calendar.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>One screen to manage everything</h3>\n<p>With our WordPress booking calendar, we’ve delivered a revolutionary calendar and rental management design to WordPress, where you can edit almost every key thing without leaving one screen.</p>\n<p>For every booking calendar, there is a smart customizable screen to edit your rental types, availability, prices, and inventory.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add or remove rental units.</li>\n<li>Set availability and prices.</li>\n<li>Update booking statuses.</li>\n<li>Customize admin timeline view.</li>\n<li>Bulk edit or drag across multiple days.</li>\n<li>Add images and text descriptions to your rentals.</li>\n<li>View statues per rental: Available, Booked, Fully Booked, Unavailable, and more.</li>\n<li>Jump to the calendar page to customize it.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>WordPress booking calendar with dynamic pricing</h3>\n<p>The rental business is always about complex pricing scenarios! Use the price adjustment tools to integrate dynamic prices for customers using our WordPress booking plugin.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Charge based on the rental type (e.g. VIP vs regular, deluxe vs basic).</li>\n<li>Charge based on the time slot (e.g. 5 AM &#8211; 10 AM: $50 vs 10 AM &#8211; 5 PM: $100).</li>\n<li>Set flat or fixed extra charges. (<em>only in PRO</em>)</li>\n<li>Apply fees depending on what the customer selects. (<em>only in PRO</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Drag-and-drop WordPress booking form builder</h3>\n<p>Our WordPress booking calendar plugin relies on flexible forms you can build for personalized checkout experiences. Use WP booking calendar custom fields to meet your needs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Collect the exact data you need (e.g. the number of guests for a vacation rental).</li>\n<li>Use 10+ custom fields to tailor your forms (checkboxes, dropdowns, country selection, etc.).</li>\n<li>Create separate forms for different calendars.</li>\n<li>Custom form fields per rental type.</li>\n<li>Customize layout with Gutenberg blocks (headings, separators, columns).</li>\n<li>Save WordPress booking form templates and assign/re-use them for specific calendars.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Automated email notifications</h3>\n<p>Make your WordPress booking calendar function on autopilot with set-and-forget email alerts:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Send emails to clients, admins, or team members.</li>\n<li>Trigger messages based on the calendar being used.</li>\n<li>Customize content, appearance, and recipient for each email type.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Shopping cart-style experience</h3>\n<p>Clients can book different items and dates in one transaction through the WordPress rental plugin. Provide them with a familiar e-commerce feel in your calendar booking system!</p>\n<h3>Easy embedding and calendar display</h3>\n<p>We love WordPress-native solutions. Add your WordPress booking calendar anywhere on your site:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use an automatically generated branded booking page for each calendar.</li>\n<li>Use a Gutenberg block or shortcode.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>PRO features</h3>\n<p>What’s available only in the <a href=\"https://motopress.com/products/booking-calendar/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Premium version of this WordPress booking calendar plugin</a>?</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Price adjustment form field. This field is used to adjust/recalculate pricing by rental type using flat or percentage charges.</li>\n<li>Accept payments with Stripe.</li>\n<li>Premium support.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Booking tools are what we do best</h3>\n<p>Booking solutions and scheduling tools are what we do best.</p>\n<p>Check out our other <a href=\"https://motopress.com/products/category/wordpress-calendar-plugins/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WP calendar plugins</a> built for niche businesses and backed by years of development and customer trust:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/motopress-hotel-booking-lite/\" rel=\"ugc\">Hotel Booking Plugin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/motopress-appointment-lite/\" rel=\"ugc\">Appointment Booking Plugin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://motopress.com/products/events-calendar/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Events Calendar Plugin</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Copyright</h3>\n<p>MotoPress Booking Calendar plugin, Copyright (C) 2025, MotoPress https://motopress.com/<br />\nMotoPress Booking Calendar plugin is distributed under the terms of the GNU GPL.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the Booking Calendar plugin to the /wp-content/plugins/ directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='who%20should%20use%20the%20plugin%3F'>\nWho should use the plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>This WordPress booking calendar plugin is ideal for any business that works with rentals and schedules:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hotels and property owners.</li>\n<li>Activity and tour organizers.</li>\n<li>Consultants and event managers.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n<dt id='i%20installed%20the%20plugin.%20how%20to%20get%20started%3F'>\nI installed the plugin. How to get started?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Follow these steps to configure your booking calendar:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Create a calendar.</li>\n<li>Select your booking type.</li>\n<li>Add bookable items like rooms, properties, or equipment by creating variations. Each variation is a unique bookable type.</li>\n<li>Set inventory for each variation: add the number of available units for each rental variation using the inventory management feature.</li>\n<li>Customize availability and pricing.</li>\n<li>Adjust availability settings to reflect days or time slots when bookings are allowed.</li>\n<li>Customize the checkout/booking form, including variation-specific fields.</li>\n<li>Customize the calendar page (automatically generated or by using shortcodes or blocks).</li>\n</ol>\n</p>\n<dt id='what%20are%20the%20top%20motopress%20booking%20calendar%20features%20at%20a%20glance%3F'>\nWhat are the top MotoPress Booking Calendar features at a glance?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Our WordPress calendar booking plugin is a work in progress, but here is what you get at the moment:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Full-day bookings</li>\n<li>Multi-day bookings</li>\n<li>Changeover days</li>\n<li>Hourly bookings</li>\n<li>Availability calendar</li>\n<li>Booking form</li>\n<li>Custom checkout fields per rental</li>\n<li>Calendar overview</li>\n<li>Inventory management</li>\n<li>Booking panel</li>\n<li>User-specific notifications</li>\n<li>Advanced availability management</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.3.0, Oct 9 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added the Pay on-site payment option.</li>\n<li>Added the new booking confirmation mode requiring admin approval.</li>\n<li>Added the ability to set a custom name for a timeslot (e.g., Half-day).</li>\n<li>Added the ability to set a short text under the rental type title to highlight its key details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.0, Sep 22 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added the ability to receive payments through Stripe gateway.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0, Jul 16 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor bugfixes and improvements.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0, Jun 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "WordPress booking calendar plugin for daily, nightly, and hourly rentals.",
